      "title": "CMake: Add missing configure check for timegm()",
      "message": "CMake: Add missing configure check for timegm()\n\nWe have code that conditionally uses timegm() in time_util.c,\nbut no configure check for it. Fix that.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2023-09-04T19:59:52.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "João Valverde",
      "committer_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "committed_date": "2023-09-05T01:41:04.000+00:00",
